      "type": "{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is a form builder for Google Sheets?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A form builder that automatically syncs responses to Google Sheets, so you don't have to copy data over by hand. Formester sends every submission straight into your chosen spreadsheet.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How do I send form data to Google Sheets?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Use Formester's Google Sheets integration to link your form to a spreadsheet: open the form's Automate tab, choose Google Sheets, connect your Google account, and pick a sheet.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can I link a contact form to Google Sheets for free?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes. Formester lets you send contact form data to Google Sheets on the free plan.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can I sync multiple forms to the same Google Sheet?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes. You can connect multiple forms and organize their responses across different tabs in the same spreadsheet.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What happens if I delete a row in Google Sheets?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The submission stays safe in Formester, but it won't be restored in Google Sheets. Your Formester dashboard remains the source of truth.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What if my form stops sending data to Google Sheets?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Reconnect the integration from the form's Automate tab. If the issue continues, contact our support team and we'll help you sort it out.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is Formester?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Formester is an online form builder for creating forms, surveys, and quizzes with a drag-and-drop editor or AI. It connects with the tools your team already uses — Google Sheets, Slack, HubSpot, Zapier, and more — so your form data flows wherever you need it.\"}}]}"
