    {
      "id": 1329,
      "__component": "macro-components.faqs",
      "description": null,
      "centered": true,
      "title": [
        {
          "id": 5162,
          "text": "Google Sheets integration FAQs",
          "highlight": false,
          "color": "#475467",
          "bold": false
        }
      ],
      "faqList": [
        {
          "id": 2739,
          "header": "What is a form builder for Google Sheets?",
          "body": "A form builder that automatically syncs responses to Google Sheets, so you don't have to copy data over by hand. Formester sends every submission straight into your chosen spreadsheet.",
          "body_markdown": "",
          "list": []
        },
        {
          "id": 2740,
          "header": "How do I send form data to Google Sheets?",
          "body": "Use Formester's Google Sheets integration to link your form to a spreadsheet: open the form's Automate tab, choose Google Sheets, connect your Google account, and pick a sheet.",
          "body_markdown": "",
          "list": []
        },
        {
          "id": 2741,
          "header": "Can I link a contact form to Google Sheets for free?",
          "body": "Yes. Formester lets you send contact form data to Google Sheets on the free plan.",
          "body_markdown": "",
          "list": []
        },
        {
          "id": 2742,
          "header": "Can I sync multiple forms to the same Google Sheet?",
          "body": "Yes. You can connect multiple forms and organize their responses across different tabs in the same spreadsheet.",
          "body_markdown": "",
          "list": []
        },
        {
          "id": 2744,
          "header": "What happens if I delete a row in Google Sheets?",
          "body": "The submission stays safe in Formester, but it won't be restored in Google Sheets. Your Formester dashboard remains the source of truth.",
          "body_markdown": "",
          "list": []
        },
        {
          "id": 2743,
          "header": "What if my form stops sending data to Google Sheets?",
          "body": "Reconnect the integration from the form's Automate tab. If the issue continues, contact our support team and we'll help you sort it out.",
          "body_markdown": "",
          "list": []
        },
        {
          "id": 2745,
          "header": "What is Formester?",
          "body": "Formester is an online form builder for creating forms, surveys, and quizzes with a drag-and-drop editor or AI. It connects with the tools your team already uses — Google Sheets, Slack, HubSpot, Zapier, and more — so your form data flows wherever you need it.",
          "body_markdown": "",
          "list": []
        }
      ]
    },
